[48;2;247;223;238m[38;2;147;48;107m[1m Q5 [22m[38;2;36;31;27m The secret is that you called the tow company and gave the wrong location. You stood in the kitchen, snow falling outside, and let the phone ring in your hand until the line went dead. [0m

